A simple and complete app for self-timer, continuous shooting and selfie, with grills, timer and adjustable intervals! 

Features: 
- Works on iPhone, iPad and iPod touch; 
- Timer first photo, adjustable from 0s to 120s; 
- Multiple shots, adjustable from 1 to 200; 
- Timer for multiple shots in sequence and adjustable from 2s to 120s; 
- Flash on, off, automatic; 
- Turn on the flashlight to illuminate the scene; 
- Beep sound for 5 seconds before each shot (can be disabled); 
- Auto-save in the photo gallery (can be disabled); 
- Three grids to better frame the scene (rule of thirds and the golden section); 
- Automatic recognition of faces; 
- Front and rear camera; 
- Digital Zoom; 
- Focus Automatic or manual; 
- Preview photos in high definition; 
- Share photos on social networks, or with your favorite applications, printing, copying, use as background Wallpaper! 


For information or suggestions, please use the Contact Us form in the Info menu of the application.

Watercolorizer is very simple to use and does not require any artistic skill. It provides many effect presets with different watercolor techniques. It also provides quite user-friendly interface, you can easily create paintings that show your unique artistic charm by trying to adjust different style effects, details and paper quality!

Easy:
To turn your photos into beautiful watercolor art, you just need drag and drop your photo into Photo Watercolorizer window.

Key features:
- 21 preset watercolor effects that you can easily choose from;
- Fine-tune your painting to get the favorite effect with the detail control;
- Three types of paper: smooth(hot-pressed), medium(cold-pressed) and rough;
- Adjust brightness and contrast;
- Two painting modes of HD and Full HD can be selected;
- Export high-resolution pictures;
- Display the watercolor painting effects in real time;
- Compare instantly the Original/Watercolor paintings;
- Support many photo image formats:JPG, TIFF, PNG, BMP, GIF, JPF…

